{"chunk_id": "2db890440100", "text": "After the fall of Ravana\u2019s forces, Hanuman returns to Rama with Sita\u2019s message: she longs to see her lord again after the long torment of captivity. Moved by the news, Rama\u2014overcome with emotion\u2014orders Vibhishana to bring Sita before him, bathed and adorned with celestial perfumes and jewels. Though Sita wishes to see her husband immediately without bathing, she ultimately obeys Rama\u2019s command out of devotion. She is prepared and carried in a palanquin under Vibhishana\u2019s escort. When Rama learns she has arrived, conflicting emotions surge within him\u2014joy, anger, and grief from her long stay in the enemy\u2019s palace. Concealing his happiness, he asks that she be brought closer, foreshadowing the difficult test he is about to impose. The chapter marks the tense prelude to the famous trial of Sita\u2019s purity.\nAfter hearing Sita longs to see him, Rama orders Vibhishana to bring her adorned, and she is carried in a palanquin to meet him.\nThemes: reunion anticipation, devotion and duty, messenger loyalty, royal protocol, emotional restraint", "vector": [0.005631532520055771, -0.017390010878443718, -0.0017828131094574928, 0.016473328694701195, -0.011748367920517921, 0.02034226804971695, -0.01937166415154934, -0.003233665833249688, -0.02507396973669529, 0.00033575191628187895, 0.007650257088243961, 0.018387578427791595, 0.007906388491392136, 0.007124512456357479, 0.00413855304941535, -0.005463025067001581, 0.049905288964509964, -0.007899648509919643, 0.025963691994547844, -0.019776081666350365, 0.0024669549893587828, -0.01733608916401863, -0.01759222149848938, 0.009382518008351326, -0.04448607563972473, -0.010878867469727993, 0.031868208199739456, -0.04195171594619751, 0.01015765406191349, -0.004832805600017309, -0.020288346335291862, -0.018872881308197975, -0.01645984873175621, -0.0031831134110689163, -0.015758855268359184, 0.0024197727907449007, -0.004542971961200237, -0.012948144227266312, 0.0